<!--
id: D02
name: Payment final notice
layout: base
kind: campaign
sender: hi
category: billing
topic: none
trigger: same campaign as D01; wait 5 days; exit if payment_succeeded
phase: 2
subject: Final notice: your payment is still due
preheader: Update your payment details to avoid an interruption.
footer_reason: You're receiving this because a payment for your Hydrilla plan is still outstanding.
optional: false
data: event.plan_name, event.billing_url
-->
<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>The payment for your {{ event.plan_name | default: "Hydrilla" }} plan still hasn't gone through. This is the last reminder we'll send.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Update your payment details now to keep generating without an interruption.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{ event.billing_url | default: 'https://hydrilla.ai/app/pricing' }}">Update payment details</mj-button>
